Error [E0071]: this effect-only `if` uses a result arrow
  --> tests/ui/subjectless_guard_direct_nesting.jet:2:13
    |
  2 |     if true -> if false -> print("never")
    |             ^^
 Why: an arrow says that control selects a value; this body only performs work
 Fix: remove `->`; keep the one-line body adjacent or use braces

Error [E0329]: a nested one-line `if` needs braces
  --> tests/ui/subjectless_guard_direct_nesting.jet:2:16
    |
  2 |     if true -> if false -> print("never")
    |                ^^
 Why: an adjacent body owns one non-`if` statement, so direct nesting is ambiguous
 Fix: wrap the nested `if` in `{ ... }`
